OL,3,GNEWSAClarkson's Farm sheep 'theft'
OL,4,Aactually a miscount
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe apparent theft of sheep from Jeremy
OL,7,FClarkson's Diddly Squat Farm was in
OL,8,Ffact due to a miscount by farm staff,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police first said it
OL,12,Freceived reports on 2 September that
OL,13,Fthe animals had been taken from the
OL,14,Ffarm in Chadlington, Oxfordshire,
OL,15,Fwithin the last 10 days.
OL,17,FThe 66-year-old ex-Top Gear presenter
OL,18,Ftold The Sun he discovered the animals
OL,19,Fwere missing when he went to count his
OL,20,Fflock with Clarkson's Farm co-star
OL,21,FKaleb Cooper.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
