OL,3,GNEWSAClarkson's Farm sheep 'theft'
OL,4,Aactually a miscount
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in an update issued on Tuesday,
OL,7,Fpolice said the reported theft had in
OL,8,Ffact been the result of an accidental
OL,9,Fmiscount by farm staff.
